The '''Pijal Hyperspace Corridor''' was a [[hyperspace route]] in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]], passing through the [[Byrnum Maw]] and the [[Pijal system]]. It was created by the [[Czerka Arms|Czerka Corporation]], who used [[hyperspace anchor]]s on [[Pijal]] and [[Pijal's moon|its moon]] to stabilize the maw, allowing travel through the area.<ref name="Master & Apprentice" />

